            {
              "entityId": -5006,
              "uuid": "d24db3ae-e1c4-54ca-847e-ed7763160a08",
              "content": "```java\nMap<Integer, Integer> seen = new HashMap<>();\nfor (int i = 0; i < nums.length; i++) {\n    int need = target - nums[i];\n    if (seen.containsKey(need)) return new int[]{seen.get(need), i};\n    seen.put(nums[i], i);\n}\n```",
              "order": "00000001/00000001",
              "collapsed": false,
              "createdAt": null,
              "updatedAt": null,
              "properties": {},
              "tags": [],
              "references": [],
              "children": []
