            {
              "entityId": -5011,
              "uuid": "ac7dd4dc-f3f0-5942-8762-02acf37dee73",
              "content": "```python\nleft = 0\nfor right, ch in enumerate(s):\n    while ch in window:\n        window.remove(s[left]); left += 1\n    window.add(ch)\n    best = max(best, right - left + 1)\n```",
              "order": "00000002/00000001",
